; TORRENCE AVE GATES
RULE GATE_TORRENCE_CLOSE
IF NODE STO-334 DEPTH > 0
AND NODE STO-335 DEPTH > 0
THEN ORIFICE TORRENCEGATE SETTING = 0.
PRIORITY 1.0

RULE GATE_TORRENCE_OPEN
IF NODE STO-334 DEPTH  < -1
AND NODE STO-335 DEPTH < -1
THEN ORIFICE TORRENCEGATE SETTING = 1.
PRIORITY 1.0


